  "post_content": "<p>(20 fotos) House Cafe, en la calle Comare Elisa Meseguer, 2 de Onda, programa para los s&aacute;bados por la noche</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/SoparHouseCafeOnda.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>cena, a partir de las 21 horas, y</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/BallHouseCafeOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>baile posterior con bachatas, salsa, merengue, cha cha cha, foxtrot, cumbia, sevillanas, tango o rock. Las reservas se pueden realizar en el tel&eacute;fono 964 63 93 45.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8808.jpg\" alt=\"img_8808\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8812.jpg\" alt=\"img_8812\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8720.jpg\" alt=\"img_8720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8722.jpg\" alt=\"img_8722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8724.jpg\" alt=\"img_8724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8725.jpg\" alt=\"img_8725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8726.jpg\" alt=\"img_8726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cimcenaybaile/img_8728.jpg\" alt=\"img_8728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439